{"pageProps":{"story":{"name":"maxcluster Design System","created_at":"2025-02-03T08:28:14.011Z","published_at":"2025-07-17T13:39:30.321Z","updated_at":"2025-07-17T13:39:30.335Z","id":619395609,"uuid":"63939e2e-f343-4c74-9ee4-632a872f0c4f","content":{"_uid":"0a50eb47-353c-43a7-93b9-c65698e87178","type":"page","section":[{"_uid":"3f8384e6-fc83-4ef2-b034-480168480b93","type":"section","style":"","width":"narrow","buttons":[],"inverted":true,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"_uid":"55e71210-21fc-4de8-a699-37ef0fa23e19","text":"maxcluster, mit Sitz in Paderborn und 86 Mitarbeitern, spezialisiert sich auf das Hosting von Onlineshops und Anwendungen mit hohen Anforderungen. Sie bieten höchste Leistung und Zuverlässigkeit, indem sie komplexe Technologien für ambitionierte Agenturen und Shop-Betreiber:innen einfach nutzbar machen.","type":"text","align":"center","layout":"singleColumn","component":"text","highlightText":true}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"default","content_mode":"list","headline_sub":"Design System ","content_align":"center","content_width":"","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"maxcluster GmbH","content_gutter":"","headline_align":"","headline_large":true,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"center","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"fc8b3f19-e2ef-47a3-afc3-461ed2f8ae41","type":"section","style":"","width":"full","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"sub":"","_uid":"6153b53e-346b-438c-8be4-8bd1f16d27fe","text":"","type":"hero","height":"fullImage","buttons":[],"overlay":false,"textbox":false,"headline":"","component":"hero","image_alt":"Komposition verschiedener UI-Komponenten als dekorative Grafik","colorNeutral":false,"image_indent":"none","textPosition":"center","highlightText":false,"image_srcMobile":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/1600x630/18dff642f3/maxcluster.png","image_srcTablet":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/1600x630/18dff642f3/maxcluster.png","image_srcDesktop":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/1600x630/18dff642f3/maxcluster.png"}],"spaceAfter":"none","spaceBefore":"none","content_mode":"default","headline_sub":"","content_align":"center","content_width":"unset","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"c4a57774-b411-4a5e-a61b-aed0e2d0c76c","type":"section","style":"","width":"narrow","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"_uid":"2db3a1d8-17fc-490b-b342-4e484fd5bac8","text":"maxcluster, ein Anbieter, der komplexe Cloud-Hosting-Technologien für Agenturen und Shop-Betreiber zugänglich macht, stand vor der Herausforderung, seine Webseite zu erneuern. Das Ziel war es, eine konsistente Frontend-Erfahrung zu schaffen. Dazu wollte maxcluster eine UI-Bibliothek entwickeln, die intern weiterentwickelt und nahtlos in die bestehenden Website-Templates integriert werden konnte. Diese Erneuerung sollte nicht nur die Benutzererfahrung verbessern, sondern auch die Effizienz der internen Entwicklungsprozesse steigern.","type":"text","align":"center","layout":"singleColumn","component":"text","highlightText":false}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"default","content_mode":"list","headline_sub":"","content_align":"center","content_width":"","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"Die Herausforderung","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"center","headline_large":true,"headline_width":"","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"center","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"29814330-127c-4d51-99d6-668eacb86d9f","type":"section","style":"","width":"max","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"sub":"","_uid":"54bb8233-2952-4202-9fc9-f57944c491df","text":"In enger Zusammenarbeit mit maxcluster setzten wir auf einen kollaborativen Ansatz, um ihre Frontend-Herausforderungen zu meistern. Im Rahmen unserer [Design System-Initiative](/design-system-services/brauche-ich-ein-design-system) führten wir eine Workshop-Reihe durch, die maxcluster dabei unterstützte, eine fundierte Entscheidung über die Einführung eines Design Systems zu treffen. Dabei wurden ihre spezifischen Anforderungen, ihr Budget und ihre Ziele berücksichtigt.\n","type":"cta","width":"","buttons":[],"headline":"Lösung und Vorgehen","component":"cta","fullWidth":false,"image_alt":"Beispielhafte Darstellung eines Design System Audits","image_src":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/1400x947/2de5d0f323/design-system-audit.png","textAlign":"left","colorNeutral":false,"contentAlign":"center","highlightText":true,"image_padding":true,"backgroundColor":"","order_mobileImageLast":false,"order_desktopImageLast":true},{"sub":"","_uid":"7e0ee541-3d41-437a-86c0-9b1ebe1dab10","text":"maxcluster entschied sich dafür, [kickstartDS](/design-system-services/design-system-starterkit-kickstartds) in ihre Hauptseite sowie in die Karriereseiten zu integrieren. Diese Integration beschleunigte die Erstellung neuer Komponenten und Seitentypen erheblich und ermöglichte gleichzeitig eine Bereinigung der bestehenden Seiten, die zuvor auf einer improvisierten und organisch gewachsenen Designbasis beruhten. \n\nDurch diesen strukturierten Ansatz konnte maxcluster eine konsistente und effiziente Frontend-Entwicklung sicherstellen.","type":"cta","width":"","buttons":[],"headline":"","component":"cta","fullWidth":false,"image_alt":"Screenshots der maxcluster Webseite","image_src":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/1400x947/f8bca0ff49/screenshot-colors.png","textAlign":"left","colorNeutral":false,"contentAlign":"center","highlightText":false,"image_padding":true,"backgroundColor":"","order_mobileImageLast":false,"order_desktopImageLast":false}],"spaceAfter":"none","spaceBefore":"none","content_mode":"list","headline_sub":"","content_align":"","content_width":"","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"52add920-07c4-47fa-bff0-6bbc3fd82b7f","type":"section","style":"","width":"wide","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"_uid":"0476414f-5a89-4d92-8c83-79fe2be94d75","text":"**Industrie & Branche**\n\n- IT Services\n- Hosting\n- Deutschland\n\n\n--- ","type":"image-text","layout":"","component":"image-text","image_alt":"","highlightText":true},{"_uid":"6bda06ca-221d-412d-89c8-294349ad4049","text":"**Design System Services**\n\n-  Design System Audit\n- Technische Konzeption\n- Frontend-Entwicklung  \n\n---","type":"image-text","layout":"","component":"image-text","image_alt":"","highlightText":true},{"_uid":"1f5aff21-1426-4a85-9ba3-300fdf6aed90","text":"**Technologien**\n\n- HTML & CSS, BEM\n- kickstartDS\n- Storybook\n\n---","type":"image-text","layout":"","component":"image-text","image_alt":"","highlightText":true}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"default","content_mode":"","headline_sub":"","content_align":"center","content_width":"unset","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default"},{"_uid":"52b4584f-97f1-4604-b795-abfaf72ec91a","type":"section","style":"","width":"max","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"sub":"","_uid":"4d94e53e-6014-49ab-9690-e4ea4af3958f","text":"Das Projekt, das 2020 umgesetzt wurde, zeigt noch heute seine nachhaltige Wirkung. Die damals entwickelten Komponenten werden weiterhin unverändert auf der Website von maxcluster genutzt. Dies unterstreicht die Langlebigkeit und die zeitlose Performance der Lösung, die durch die Nutzung von kickstartDS als Basis erreicht wurde. \n\nDie Entscheidung für ein robustes und zukunftssicheres Design System hat maxcluster nicht nur geholfen, ihre Frontend-Entwicklung zu optimieren, sondern auch langfristig Ressourcen zu sparen und eine konsistente Benutzererfahrung zu gewährleisten.","type":"cta","width":"","buttons":[],"headline":"Impact","component":"cta","fullWidth":true,"image_alt":"Screenshot der maxcluster Webseiote","image_src":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/1400x947/76140fdd40/screenshot-jobspage.png","textAlign":"left","colorNeutral":false,"contentAlign":"center","highlightText":true,"image_padding":true,"backgroundColor":"","order_mobileImageLast":false,"order_desktopImageLast":true}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"default","content_mode":"default","headline_sub":"","content_align":"center","content_width":"unset","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"7718811e-a358-484e-aeb6-a8e925f726a3","type":"section","style":"","width":"wide","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"_uid":"1ca49156-840b-437e-b922-d83b46547d69","text":"","type":"teaser-card","image":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/1080x810/6a4ce7621a/dachser_teaser_4zu3.png","label":"","layout":"row","target":"case-studies/dachser-design-system","headline":"Dachser Design System","component":"teaser-card","imageRatio":"square","button_label":"Zum Showcase","button_hidden":true,"button_chevron":false},{"_uid":"b7086820-72d6-45b0-8fde-9bbfcc79039f","text":"","type":"teaser-card","image":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/1080x810/75a4143d37/wolfcraft_teaser_4zu3.jpg","label":"","layout":"row","target":"case-studies/wolfcraft-cms-we